  "prefLabel": "He-W 511.10 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 511.10 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before claims shall be submitted to the department’s fiscal agent in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #10632, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14075, eff 9-20-24",
